description=Fixes unstable light sampling in Search Mode (Foraging) when using a flashlight. <LINE> 'Flashlights do not shine at maximum brightness' OFF: the flashlight sets computed light to 1.0, so the Darkness Effect won’t reduce your Vision Radius. <LINE> 'Flashlights do not shine at maximum brightness' ON: applies anti-flicker smoothing with hysteresis and enforces a minimum light while the flashlight is active. This keeps the Darkness Effect stable and the Vision Radius consistent.
